---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: monitor
navKey: reports
crumbKey: crumb.reports
title: "Monthly monitor reports — Citere"
description: "How eight public AI assistants handled documented false claims about Ukraine, month by month: repeat-rate and cited sources per assistant and market."
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/monitor/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- set doc = copy.en.monitor -%}
<div class="phead"><h1>{{ doc.data.h1 }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ doc.data.lead | mdInline | safe }}</p></div>

{%- if reports | length %}
<div class="grid3">
{%- for r in reports %}
  <div class="rank"><h3>{{ r.period | default(r.date | displayDate) }} <span>{% for c in r.countries %}{{ c | upper }}{% if not loop.last %} &middot; {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span></h3>
    <div class="row"><span class="rname" style="white-space:normal">{{ r.title }}</span></div>
    {%- if reportLead[r.slug] %}
    <div class="row"><span class="rname" style="color:var(--dim);white-space:normal">{{ reportLead[r.slug] }}</span></div>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="row"><span class="rname" style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ r.n_responses }} responses &middot; {{ r.chatbots | length }} assistants</span></div>
    <a class="more" href="{{ r.url | url }}">{{ 'action.readReport' | t }} &rarr;</a></div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
{%- else %}
<div class="callout" style="margin:8px 0 0">
  <b>Monthly monitor reports are on the way.</b>
  The first monthly report will be published here once a full monitoring cycle completes.
  In the meantime, every finding to date is in the <a href="{{ '/registry/' | url }}">claim registry</a>.
</div>
{%- endif %}
<div style="height:44px"></div>
